    "title": "Steuben County launches Trap-Neuter-Return program for community cats - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Ross Underwood, Coastal TV News ,\n9 hours ago A new effort in Steuben County is expanding options for managing feral and free-roaming cat populations through a Trap-Neuter-Return program. Applications are now being accepted for a Trap-Neuter-Return, or TNR, program serving feral and free-roaming community cats in Steuben County. Officials say the program provides appointments at participating veterinary clinics... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 3",
